prov: spec:es2026@0248456c#sec-string.prototype.search spec:es2026@0248456c#sec-regexp.prototype-%symbol.search% spec:es2026@0248456c#sec-regexpcreate
script: var re = /b/; re[Symbol.search] = undefined; "abc".search(re)
note: correspondence row M6: an own %Symbol.search% of undefined: search makes RegExpCreate(re), whose pattern is ToString(re), a pattern matching /b/ itself, and "abc" has no /; read from the clauses (the match itself is regexpref's where one runs)
since: 31

